  "flow_prompt": "Create one 15 second 9:16 video with Omni Flash 1.2.\nOne continuous microscopic shot: composite single micelles spread laterally into a single monolayer within an emulsion droplet interface.\nKeep the main subject in the upper-center and leave the lower third clean and uncluttered.\nNo visible text. No typography. No captions or subtitles. No title cards. No labels or annotations. No letters, words, numbers or symbols. No logos, watermarks or UI overlays. No pseudo-text or decorative glyphs. Do not display, transcribe, translate or paraphrase any text of any language.\nResolution: 720p. Output count: 1.\nGenerate the video once in a single pass. Do not extend, loop, resume or generate additional clips.\nInstrumental music only. Generate only a gentle instrumental background score, continuous through the video. No vocals, no singing, no lyrics, no human voice, no speech, no dialogue, no narration, no chanting, no sound effects, no ambience.",
  "evidence_metadata": {
